Licence texts of libraries the core builds from extern/libretro-deps, which
carries those libraries' sources without these files:

  zlib-LICENSE           zlib 1.2.8: the notice from its own zlib.h
  FreeType-FTL.TXT       FreeType (taken under the FreeType License, one of its
                         two licences), docs/FTL.TXT of freetype/freetype
  fribidi-COPYING        FriBidi (LGPL-2.1-or-later), COPYING of fribidi/fribidi
  libogg-COPYING         libogg (BSD-3-Clause), COPYING of xiph/ogg
  libvorbis-COPYING      libvorbis (BSD-3-Clause), COPYING of xiph/vorbis
  libFLAC-COPYING.Xiph   libFLAC (BSD-3-Clause), COPYING.Xiph of xiph/flac
  libjpeg-README.ijg     the IJG licence of libjpeg-turbo's libjpeg API (its
                         LICENSE.md points to this file), README.ijg of
                         libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo

Fetched 2026-11-03 from the upstream repositories named.
